Hi Alex,

Thanks for pushing ahead on this. Let me copy Clair on this (as promised),
and she has been making steady progress on the non-parametric estimator
part, and have some good suggestions to improve upon what we have built
thus far. We haven't fully converged on that, but will share the progress
report once we have something workable.

Regarding the aivreg, I think you could share the status of wherever you
are with us. Claire and I can take a first stab at it, and if it requires
further clarification, we can schedule a call, but it would be helpful to
take a look at the issues and report. Does that work for you?

Sophie Calder-Wang
The Wharton School
University of Pennsylvania
